## Mark-Based Score Calculation [to-do]
- Calculate losses for each battalion
- Apply mark-based scoring system:
  - Mark 1 = 1 point per unit lost
  - Mark 2 = 2 points per unit lost
  - Mark 3 = 4 points per unit lost
  - Mark 4 = 8 points per unit lost
- Track all losses throughout battle
- Update loss counter in real-time
- Generate final score based on total points

## Tie-Breaking System [to-do]
